&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;If you are ready to lead engineering delivery at scale, working across complex systems and driving real business outcomes, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:210,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
